      "writtenOn": "2024-02-26T16:13:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if we have physical memory at 0x0? Maybe we\u0027re better off using e.g. `KVM_PHYS_INVALID` instead? Then again, it\u0027s possible that the host code has the same issue.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 316,
